// R40：MOD 名称 / 说明的英文、日文（mods.js 的 nm()/dm() 读取）。格式 id: [nEn, dEn, nJa, dJa]。说明为精简译文；缺项回退中文。
window.ModsI18N = {
vroid_only: ['Bodies: VRoid female models only (R51)', 'Every character body is picked by identity from 8 VRoid female bodies (Vita / Victoria Rubin / Darkness Shibu / HairSample Female / AvatarSample A / AvatarSample B / yukata Osage / new AvatarSample K·F), regardless of CC0 mode. Quaternius low-poly bodies were deleted; Genshin MMD bodies and the child-proportioned Hikari no longer appear.', '体はVRoid女性モデルのみ（第51回）', '全キャラの体を8体のVRoid女性ボディから身分に合わせて選ぶ。'],
hunter_calm: ['Slower hunter sense (R50)', 'Knockdown +2.5 (was 7), decap +1.5 (was 4); no time gain for the first 2 minutes of a trip, then ~4.5→8%/min (was 15%+); when full, rolls every 12 s at 6%→50% (was every 5 s at 15%→90%); 150 s cooldown after an encounter (was 40 s).', '猟手感応を減速（第50回）', '撃破・斬首の上昇量を減らし、開始2分は時間増加なし、満タン後の出現判定も緩やかに。遭遇後クールダウン150秒。'],
hunter_hud2: ['Hunter HUD redesign · compact (R50)', 'Hunter sense becomes a small obsidian panel at the top (segmented thin bar + one line of hate/U hint) instead of big centered text with a smeared shadow; hunter HP bar and banners restyled to match (blood-gold, chamfered, 30% flee tick).', '猟手HUD刷新（第50回）', '感応ゲージを小型パネル化。猟手HPバーとバナーも統一デザインに。'],
npc_locomo: ['Natural character movement · no more GMod sliding (R47)', 'Walk/jog/sprint are phase-synced and blended by actual speed with playback matched to stride (no foot sliding); acceleration when starting/stopping; turning has angular acceleration, arcs when running and leans into turns; no instant stop while still sliding.', 'キャラ移動の自然化（第47回）', '歩き/ジョグ/ダッシュを実速度で位相同期ブレンドし足滑りなし。発進・停止に加速度、旋回に角加速度と内傾、滑走中に急停止しない。'],
overhear_old: ['Eavesdrop box: classic style (R43)','The new top bar was judged worse than the old one, so the R28 style is back by default: a box in the lower-middle of the screen with a speech-bubble tail, a nameplate per speaker (soul tier / rank / catchphrase) and lines popping in one by one. Off = top bar + half-body portrait. Requires “Eavesdrop on arrival”.','立ち聞きボックス：旧スタイル（第43回）','新しい上部バーは旧版に劣るとのことで、第28回のスタイルを既定に戻した：画面中下のふきだし付きボックス、話者ごとのネームプレート（魂階・階位・口癖）、台詞が順に現れる。オフ＝上部バー＋半身像。「入場時の立ち聞き」が必要。'],
cs_cel: ['Character style: cel (R47)', 'Hard-edged anime shading: base / shade (environment-tinted, richer same hue) / darkest (under chin, sleeves) / stepped highlight / backlight rim, all following scene brightness and tint.', 'キャラ表現：セル（第47回）', 'くっきりしたアニメ陰影。基本色・影色・最暗部・段階ハイライト・逆光リム、すべて環境に追従。'],
cs_soft: ['Character style: soft anime (R47)', 'Wide soft terminator with a warm glow band and stronger backlight rim, like anime film lighting.', 'キャラ表現：ソフトアニメ（第47回）', '柔らかい明暗境界＋暖色の帯＋強めの逆光リム。'],
cs_paint: ['Character style: painterly (R47)', 'Anime shade colours and bands while keeping 30% of real lighting and some specular for material depth.', 'キャラ表現：厚塗り（第47回）', 'アニメの影色と段階に、実ライティング3割とハイライトを残して厚みを出す。'],
cs_real: ['Character style: realistic relative (R47)', 'Previous version: PBR, shadows lifted to 40% of local full light, backlight rim. No outline.', 'キャラ表現：リアル相対光（第47回）', '前バージョン：PBR、影をその場の全光量40%まで持ち上げ、逆光リム。線なし。'],
char_outline: ['Character outline (R47)', 'Thin outline around bodies and heads (inverted hull, thinner at distance); line colour comes from the texture and darkens/tints with the environment.', 'キャラ輪郭線（第47回）', '体と頭の輪郭に細い線（遠くは細く）。線色はテクスチャ由来で環境に合わせて変化。'],
world_cel: ['Anime shadows on environment (R47)', 'Scene keeps its 3D textured materials, but shadow edges are crisper, shadows take the sky colour and lit sides are slightly flatter, matching anime characters.', '環境アニメ影（第47回）', '3D質感は保ちつつ、影の境界をくっきり・空の色で影を染めてキャラの影と揃える。'],
char_unify: ['Unified character lighting · no uncanny backlight (R47)', 'Heads and bodies share one environment-relative anime shading: shadows are 40% of the local full light (never brighter than the scene, no self-lit cardboard look), lit side untouched, and a sun-coloured rim appears on the silhouette when backlit. Bypasses the old anime shade / SSS / face-light floor while on.', 'キャラ統一ライティング・逆光でも不気味にならない（第47回）', '頭と体が同じ環境相対のアニメ陰影を使う：影はその場の全光量の40%（周囲より明るくならず、自発光の紙人形にならない）、明部はそのまま、逆光時は輪郭に太陽色のリムライト。オン時は旧アニメ陰影/SSS/顔補光の下限を無効化。'],
id_look: ['Identity decides hair / headwear / outfit colour (R43)', 'Looks used to depend only on race (nuns in bunny ears, knights with bows). Now by identity: matching hair colours, refitted headwear (nun = veil, witch = pointed hat, princess = tiara, queen = crown, smith/alchemist = goggles, ranger = feathers) and outfits recoloured to fit the role (black habit, steel-grey knight, forest-green ranger, crimson queen). Overlords unchanged.', '身分で髪色・髪飾り・服の色が決まる（第43回）', '外見は種族だけで決まっていた（兎耳の修道女、リボンの騎士）。今は身分で：髪色、髪飾り（修道女＝ベール、魔女＝とんがり帽、姫＝ティアラ、女王＝王冠、鍛冶・錬金＝ゴーグル、レンジャー＝羽）、服の色（黒い修道服、鋼色の騎士、森の緑のレンジャー、深紅の女王）。覇者は変わらない。'],
foe_press: ['Enemies press & predict (R43)', 'Enemies step toward you between wind-up and strike (heavy attacks step further), the hit reach extends with the lunge, they lead your movement by 0.25 s when turning, and a whiffed attack is followed up immediately if you are still close.', '敵が詰める・先読みする（第43回）', '敵は振りかぶりから命中までの間に踏み込み（強攻撃はより大きく）、命中距離も前進分だけ伸びる。向きは0.25秒先のあなたの動きを読み、空振り後も近くにいればすぐ追撃する。'],
back_slow: ['Slower retreat in combat (R43)', 'While an enemy that has noticed you is within 14 m and not fleeing, walking backwards is ~55% speed; strafing/forward unchanged. To disengage, turn and run. Enemy heavy attacks step forward as they strike, so you can no longer back-pedal forever.', '戦闘中は後退が遅い（第43回）', 'こちらに気付いた敵が14m以内（逃走中以外）にいる間、後ろ歩きは約55%の速度。横移動・前進は変わらず。離脱するには背を向けて走る。敵の強攻撃は踏み込みながら出るので、延々と下がって避けることはできない。'],
view_toggle: ['First / third person toggle (R41, press V)', 'Press V (when not holding a head) to switch between first and third person; third person is an over-the-shoulder camera with collision, showing the goblin body.', '一人称／三人称切替（第41回、Vキー）', 'V（首を持っていない時）で一人称と三人称を切り替え。三人称は衝突判定付きの肩越しカメラでゴブリンの体が見える。'],
fp_hands: ['First-person ogre hands (R41)', 'See the ogre\'s green hands and forearms in first person; the right hand grips the weapon and follows slashes/blocks.', '一人称のオークの手（第41回）', '一人称でオークの緑の手と前腕が見える。右手が武器を握り、斬り・防御に追従する。'],
cfx3d: ['3D combat effects (R41)', 'Crescent slash arcs, sparks, blood mist and impact rings drawn in the 3D scene on hit, plus a blade trail on swings.', '3D戦闘エフェクト（第41回）', '命中時に3D空間へ三日月の斬光・火花・血しぶき・衝撃リングを描き、振りには刃の軌跡を付ける。'],
head_natural: ['More natural head ratio (R43)', 'Heads are 10% smaller: they used to be about 1:5.8 of body height (bobblehead look); now about 1:6.5. Turn off for the old size.', '自然な頭身（第43回）', '頭を10%小さく：以前は身長の約1:5.8で大頭人形のようだった。今は約1:6.5。オフで旧サイズ。'],
death_cine: ['Fall in place on death (R50)', 'On death the camera drops and tilts where you fell, fades to black, then the death screen appears. Before, you were teleported back to the cave first. Turn off for the old flow.', 'その場で倒れる（第50回）', '死亡時、その場でカメラが倒れ込み暗転してから死亡画面へ。以前は洞窟へ転送されていた。オフで旧フロー。'],
ground_props: ['Rocks sit on the ground (R50)', 'Large props (rocks, stumps...) are placed on the lowest ground under their footprint and sunk slightly, instead of hovering on slopes. Turn off for the old placement.', '岩を地面に設置（第50回）', '大きな小道具（岩・切り株など）は足元の最も低い地面に合わせて少し沈め、斜面で浮かないように。オフで旧配置。'],
water_fx: ['Water surface (R50)', 'Soft shorelines instead of a hard-edged plate, bright shallows, shore foam, finer ripples, deeper deep water. Turn off for the old water.', '水面の質感（第50回）', '硬い縁の板ではなく岸辺がなじむ・浅瀬が明るい・岸の泡・細かい波紋・深みが濃く。オフで旧水面。'],
shell_grass: ['Shell-textured grass (R50)', 'Fuzzy ground cover rendered with shaders (no grass models, no textures): blades taper and sway near the camera, fade back to the ground beyond 26m. No grass on paths, shores and steep slopes; sparse in dry regions. Turn off for bare ground.', 'シェル草地（第50回）', 'シェーダーのシェル法で地面に毛並みの草を描画（草モデル・テクスチャなし）。カメラ近くで細くなりながら風に揺れ、26m先で地面に戻る。道・水辺・急斜面には生えず、乾燥地は疎ら。オフで裸地。'],
fast_load: ['Faster loading (R49)', 'Enter maps faster: enemy bodies / animations / beast models load in parallel with scene assets, fixed waits removed (260ms fade + 60ms), synchronous model decode (faster), far terrain ring (unreachable) sampled every 3rd vertex and interpolated. Turn off for the old flow.', '読み込み高速化（第49回）', 'マップ突入が速く：敵の体・モーション・野獣モデルとシーン資産を並列ロード、固定待ち（260ms+60ms）を撤廃、モデルのデコードは同期化、遠景の地形は3格ごとに計算して補間。オフで旧フロー。'],
id_outfit: ['Identity decides outfit (R43)', 'CC0 mode has only 4 bodies, which used to be assigned by hash (nuns in witch dresses, knights in princess gowns). Now by identity: fighters/adventurers = teal strapped outfit, nobles/clergy/singers = pink-white gown, witches/alchemists/dark types = deep-blue dress, commoners/shepherds/herbalists/nuns = plain white dress; overlords follow region style.', '身分で服が決まる（第43回）', 'CC0モードは体が4種だけで、以前はハッシュで適当に割り当て（修道女が魔女の服、騎士が姫のドレス）。今は身分で固定：戦闘・冒険系＝青黒の装い、貴族・聖職・歌い手＝桃白のドレス、魔女・錬金・闇系＝紺のドレス、平民・羊飼い・薬師・修道女＝素朴な白。覇者は地域の雰囲気に合わせる。'],
r_classic: ['Classic rendering', 'No post-processing; lightest on performance.', 'クラシック描画', '後処理なし。最も軽量。'],
r_illust: ['Illustration', 'Anisotropic Kuwahara brush strokes + ink outlines + paper grain + soft bloom, like a thick-paint illustration.', 'イラスト風', '異方性Kuwahara筆致＋墨線の輪郭＋紙の質感＋柔らかな光のにじみ。厚塗りイラストのような画面。'],
r_anime: ['Cel animation', 'Bold outlines + banded lighting + high saturation + blown highlights, like a TV anime frame.', 'セルアニメ', '太い輪郭線＋階調化した陰影＋高彩度＋ハイライトの溢れ。TVアニメのワンシーンのように。'],
r_water: ['Watercolor', 'Bleeding pigment, pooled edges, paper grain and a slight hand-drawn wobble.', '水彩', '絵具のにじみ、縁の溜まり、紙の粒子、わずかな手描きの揺れ。'],
r_oil: ['Oil painting', 'Heavy Kuwahara strokes + canvas texture + warm tones.', '油絵', '強めのKuwahara筆致＋キャンバス質感＋暖色調。'],
r_film: ['Dark cinema', 'Cinematic grading + bloom + vignette + film grain + slight chromatic aberration.', 'ダークシネマ', 'シネマ調の色彩＋ブルーム＋ビネット＋フィルムグレイン＋わずかな色収差。'],
r_ink: ['Ink wash', 'Desaturated + ink lines + rice paper; only blood and soul-light stay red.', '水墨', '脱色＋墨線＋和紙。血と魂光の赤だけを残す。'],
outline: ['Extra outline', 'Adds thin ink lines on any style (conflicts with Cel / Ink, which have their own).', '追加の輪郭線', '任意の画風に細い墨線を重ねる（セル/水墨は輪郭線内蔵のため競合）。'],
bloom: ['Soul-light bloom', 'Soul light, fire and rare light pillars glow softly.', '魂光ブルーム', '魂光・炎・レアの光柱が柔らかく発光する。'],
ui3a: ['AAA UI skin', 'Obsidian + blood-gold theme: beveled buttons, corner-bracketed panels, SVG icons, spotlight cards, health-bar ghosting, hit / low-HP feedback, hover & click sounds, menu embers. Off = old UI.', 'AAA風UIスキン', '黒曜石＋血金のテーマ：斜めカットのボタン、四隅飾りのパネル、SVGアイコン、スポットライトカード、HPバー残像、被弾/低HP演出、ホバー/クリック音、メニューの火の粉。オフで旧UI。'],
lod: ['Ten-thousand-heads optimization', 'Distant heads are downgraded / hidden and sleeping heads skip physics — supports 10,000+ heads (cold storage). Strongly recommended.', '万首最適化', '遠くの首は自動で簡略化/非表示、休眠中の首は物理計算なし。1万個以上の首に対応（冷凍保管）。強く推奨。'],
perf2: ['Smoothness II', 'Render savings without changing visuals: campfire shadows redraw only when the scene really changes; same-material trinkets on heads are batched (~¼ fewer draw calls per head). Stable FPS also stops adaptive quality from dropping settings.', 'スムーズ化 II', '見た目を変えない描画軽量化：焚き火の影はシーン変化時のみ再描画、首の同素材の小物は自動バッチ化（首1つあたりdraw call約1/4減）。FPSが安定すると自動画質ダウンも起きにくい。'],
steady_save: ['Smooth autosave', 'Saves every 20 s while the browser is idle (and immediately when you leave the page) to reduce periodic hitches. Off = old 8 s synchronous save.', 'スムーズ自動セーブ', 'ブラウザのアイドル時に20秒ごとに自動セーブ（ページを離れる際は即保存）。定期的なカクつきを軽減。オフで旧8秒同期セーブ。'],
ground_contact: ['Heads rest on the ground', 'Computes support height from skin and the cut face, ignoring hair tips, masks and headwear that would float the head. Old saves supported.', '首を地面に接地', '肌と断面のジオメトリから支持高さを算出。毛先・マスク・頭飾りによる浮きを排除。旧セーブ対応。'],
lowspec: ['Low-spec mode', 'Turns off all post-processing and hair sway, lowers resolution. Conflicts with every art style (except Classic), bloom and hair breeze.', '低スペックモード', '後処理と髪の揺れをすべてオフ、解像度を下げる。全画風（クラシック除く）・ブルーム・髪のそよ風と競合。'],
head_repair: ['Head appearance repair', 'Aligns the real neck-cut plane and caps the neck by its contour; uses CC0 flesh PBR textures and reduces odd green skin and dark eye whites.', '首の外観修復', '実際の切断面に合わせ、首の輪郭で蓋をする。CC0の肉質PBRテクスチャを使い、不自然な緑肌や暗い白目を軽減。'],
hair_cover: ['Back-of-head / nape fill (R21)', 'Some face models have no back of head or nape, so borrowed hair can reveal the inside of the face. Swaps in hair that covers well via an offline score table (js/hair_cover.js). Off = original combos.', '後頭部・うなじ補完（R21）', '後頭部やうなじのない顔モデルでは、借りた髪で覆えず顔の内側が見えることがある。オフラインのスコア表（js/hair_cover.js）で覆える髪に自動で差し替える。オフで元の組合せ。'],
nape_fill: ['Back-of-head / nape completion (R25)', 'MMD face models are just a “front mask” with an empty back. Adds a skin-toned inner shell inferred from each head’s own face shape (hidden under face and hair), joined to the cut face. Off = as before.', '後頭部・うなじ完全補完（R25）', 'MMDの顔モデルは「前面の仮面」だけで後頭部が空。各頭の顔型から頭蓋の輪郭を推定し、肌色の内殻を追加（顔と髪の内側に隠れる）、断面につなぐ。オフで元どおり。'],
hair_mix2: ['Cross-head hairstyles: MMD hair mixing (R25)', 'Lends the original hairstyles (colors and accessories included) of 56 MMD heads to other faces. Every face × hair pair is scored against the original owner (coverage, clipping, stretch 0.8–1.25, bangs not blocking eyes); bad hair is never lent out. Only ~45% of pairs pass. New heads only.', '頭またぎ髪型：MMD髪型ミックス（R25）', '56のMMD頭の原作髪型（配色・髪飾り込み）を他の顔に貸し出す。各「顔×髪型」は元の持ち主を基準に採点（被覆・めり込み・伸縮0.8〜1.25・前髪が目を隠さない）。不合格の髪は貸さない（合格率約45%）。新規生成の首のみ。'],
acc_mix: ['Cross-head accessory library (R25)', 'Hats, crowns, flowers and pins taken from MMD heads are scaled to the skull, seated by gap from the skull and pre-checked per piece (no clipping, no blocking eyes or face, no floating, not swallowed by hair). Max 2 pieces; more common at higher soul tiers. New heads only.', '頭またぎ髪飾りライブラリ（R25）', 'MMD頭から外した帽子・冠・花飾り・簪などを頭蓋サイズに合わせて等比縮尺し、頭蓋との隙間で配置。1点ずつ事前検査（めり込み・顔や目を隠す・浮き・髪に埋没は不採用）。最大2点、魂階が高いほど多い。新規生成の首のみ。'],
pack_hsr: ['Head pack: Star Rail ×12 (R25)', 'Official MMD heads: Kafka, Himeko, Black Swan, Acheron, Jingliu, Ruan Mei, Aglaea, Castorice, Tingyun, Hysilens, Feixiao, Robin. Come with their original headwear. Off = not loaded (faster start). Reload needed. Private use only.', 'ヘッドパック：スターレイル12人（R25）', '公式MMD頭：カフカ、姫子、ブラックスワン、黄泉、鏡流、ルアン・メェイ、アグライア、キャストリス、停雲、ヒュセイン、飛霄、ロビン。原作の頭飾り付き。オフで読込なし（起動が速い）。要再読込。私的利用のみ。'],
pack_zzz: ['Head pack: Zenless Zone Zero ×11 (R25)', 'Official MMD heads: Zhu Yuan, Jane, Yanagi, Miyabi, Jia Yin, Evelyn, Vivian, Yixuan, Ysolde, Ocitia, Lucia. Off = not loaded. Reload needed. Private use only.', 'ヘッドパック：ゼンレスゾーンゼロ11人（R25）', '公式MMD頭：朱鳶、ジェーン、月城柳、星見雅、耀嘉音、エヴリン、ヴィヴィアン、儀玄、イゾルデ、オチティア、ルシア。オフで読込なし。要再読込。私的利用のみ。'],
pack_nte: ['Head pack: Neverness to Everness ×9 (R25)', 'Official MMD heads: Hathor, Fadia, Lacrimosa, Kyūgen, Shinku, Zankō, Kurotori, Alphard, Nanally. Off = not loaded. Reload needed. Private use only.', 'ヘッドパック：NTE（異環）9人（R25）', '公式MMD頭：ハソル、ファディア、ラクリモーサ、九原、真紅、残光、黒鳥、アルファード、ナナリー。オフで読込なし。要再読込。私的利用のみ。'],
pack_voc: ['Head pack: classic VOCALOID ×9 (R27)', 'Animasa-style Miku / KAITO / MEIKO / Yowane, YYB 10th-anniv. Miku, Racing 2022, VBS Miku, IA, Yuzuki Yukari. Off = not loaded. Reload needed. Private use only.', 'ヘッドパック：クラシックVOCALOID9人（R27）', 'あにまさ式ミク/KAITO/MEIKO/弱音、YYB10周年ミク、Racing 2022、VBSミク、IA、結月ゆかり。オフで読込なし。要再読込。私的利用のみ。'],
pack_touhou: ['Head pack: Touhou Project ×4 (R27)', 'Fujiwara no Mokou, Houraisan Kaguya, Yakumo Ran, Yakumo Yukari. Off = not loaded. Reload needed. Private use only.', 'ヘッドパック：東方Project4人（R27）', '藤原妹紅、蓬莱山輝夜、八雲藍、八雲紫。オフで読込なし。要再読込。私的利用のみ。'],
pack_cls: ['Head pack: classic MMD ×13 (R27)', 'Tda-style Rem, Thor, 2B, Mikasa, Enoshima Junko, Brahma, Qin Shi Huang, six LoveLive girls. Off = not loaded. Reload needed. Private use only.', 'ヘッドパック：クラシックMMD13人（R27）', 'Tda式レム、トール、2B、ミカサ、江ノ島盾子、梵天、秦始皇、ラブライブ6人。オフで読込なし。要再読込。私的利用のみ。'],
load_veil: ['Atmospheric loading text (R29)', 'While loading, shows rotating mood lines + overall progress instead of file / character names. Off = “Loading head models xx% · name”.', 'ロード画面の雰囲気テキスト（R29）', 'ロード中にファイル名やキャラ名を出さず、雰囲気のある短文と全体進捗を表示。オフで従来の「首モデル読込 xx% · 名前」。'],
char_lift: ['Brighter character shadows (R29)', 'Lifts the darkest toon-shading band shared by heads and bodies from 47% to 65%: characters in the cave / at night no longer go black, and head and body keep one lighting curve. Reload needed.', 'キャラの暗部持ち上げ（R29）', '首と体で共有するトゥーン陰影の最暗段を47%→65%に引き上げ。洞窟内・夜でもキャラが真っ黒にならず、首と体は同じライティング曲線のまま。要再読込。'],
head_tone: ['Matching head & body skin tone (R26j)', 'Outdoors: head toon lighting uses the same linear response as the body within full light (the old soft compression made heads only 75% as bright), plus the body’s 40% indirect sky light. Heads stop looking darker / greyer. Cave display unchanged.', '頭と体の肌色統一（R26j）', '屋外：頭のトゥーンライティングを満光内で体と同じ線形応答に（旧ソフト圧縮で頭は体の75%の明るさだった）、空の環境光による間接光（40%）も追加。頭が体より暗く灰色に見えなくなる。洞内の展示は変更なし。'],
body_match: ['Outfit matches hair color (R29)', 'When choosing a body for a head, weights outfit colors by harmony with the hair: same family first, neighbors next, clashes rare; black/white/grey outfits go with anything. Still limited to bodies valid for that identity.', '髪色に合わせた衣装（R29）', '首に合わせる体を選ぶとき、髪色と衣装の主色の調和で重み付け：同系色優先、近い色が次点、ぶつかる色は稀。白黒灰の服はどの髪とも合う。その身分で使える体の中からのみ選ぶ。'],
tier_look: ['Look varies by soul tier (R25)', 'Mortal souls are plain: dull hair, few accessories, mostly ordinary faces, paler skin. Spirit / Hero tiers grow more ornate; Holy / Divine are mostly master-grade MMD heads with crowns and circlets, more highlights and odd-eye colors, and Divine heads sometimes have glowing eyes. New heads only.', '魂階ごとの外見差（R25）', '凡魂は地味：くすんだ髪色、装飾少なめ、普通の顔、青白い肌。霊魂/英魂と段階ごとに華やかに。聖魂/神魂は名作MMD頭（原作の精緻な頭飾り）が中心で、金冠・銀冠・額飾り、メッシュや左右異色の瞳が増え、神魂は時に瞳が発光。新規生成の首のみ。'],
vroid_bodies: ['New bodies: six VRoid sets (R24)', 'Adds 5 non-Genshin bodies from pixiv’s official CC0 VRoid models (original outfits): Vita battle outfit, Victoria Rubin white dress, Darkness Shibu blue-flower gown, HairSample white dress, AvatarSample B street jacket — plus Iwashi’s yukata girl. Assigned by outfit style; skin tint follows the head. Off = old bodies only.', '新ボディ：VRoid 6種（R24）', 'pixiv公式CC0 VRoidモデルの純正衣装から非原神ボディを5体追加：Vita戦闘服、Victoria Rubin白ドレス、Darkness Shibu青花ロングドレス、HairSample白ワンピ、AvatarSample Bストリートジャケット。加えてIwashiの浴衣少女。衣装の雰囲気に応じて身分へ割当、肌色は首に合わせて染まる。オフで旧ボディのみ。'],
head_norm: ['Head size normalization (R24)', 'MMD-pipeline heads are ~20% smaller than VRoid heads and look tiny on bodies. Scales them to standard size by face width on load (reload needed).', '頭サイズ正規化（R24）', 'MMDパイプラインの頭はVRoidより約2割小さく、体に付けると極端に小さく見える。読込時に顔幅で標準サイズへ等比拡大（要再読込）。'],
head_norm2: ['Head-to-body proportion fix (R30, replaces the above)', 'Normalizes all non-VRoid heads to the VRoid standard using face width + eye spacing, scaling up or down: Star Rail / ZZZ / NTE / classic MMD are no longer big-head dolls and mis-measured heads are no longer tiny. Overrides “Head size normalization”. Reload needed.', '頭身比率の修正（R30、上の項目を置換）', '非VRoid頭すべてを顔幅＋両目間隔の2指標でVRoid標準に正規化（拡大縮小とも）。スターレイル/ゼンゼロ/NTE/クラシックMMDが大頭人形にならず、誤測定で小さすぎる頭もなくなる。有効時は「頭サイズ正規化」は無効。要再読込。'],
anime_shade: ['Anime shading (R36)', 'Characters (head, hair, body) get anime-style lighting: flat lit areas, shadows lifted to ~80% with warm-pink tint, soft mid transition, no plastic speculars or env reflections, and a thin rim light. Sky / sun / fire / shadows still respond; very dark scenes stay dark. Reload needed. (R36b: off by default since the user wants 3D shader style.) Off = R33 PBR lighting.', 'アニメ調ライティング（R36）', 'キャラ（頭・髪・体）のライティングをアニメ風に：明部はフラット、暗部は約80%まで持ち上げて暖かいピンクの影色に、中間は柔らかく遷移。プラスチック的な反射を除き、淡いリムライトを追加。空/太陽/焚き火/影には通常どおり反応、極暗環境は暗いまま。要再読込。（R36b：3Dシェーダー志向のため初期はオフ）オフ＝R33のPBR。'],
head_native: ['Heads stay original: no hair / accessory mixing (R36b)', 'Every head is itself: face, hairstyle and headwear come from the same model, with no borrowed hair / accessories (mixing Genshin-style MMD heads looks off); no extra procedural headwear on MMD heads. On load this turns off “hair_mix2 / acc_mix”; to mix, turn this off and enable those two by hand. Reload needed.', '頭は原型のまま：髪型・髪飾りを混ぜない（R36b）', '各頭はそれ自身：顔・髪型・頭飾りが同じモデル由来で、他の頭の髪型/髪飾りを付けない（原神系MMD頭は混ぜると違和感）。MMD頭への手続き的頭飾りの追加もなし。読込時に「hair_mix2 / acc_mix」をオフにする。混ぜたい場合はこれをオフにして2項目を手動でオン。要再読込。'],
cc0_only: ['CC0 mode: CC0 models only (R38)', 'Only CC0 (public-domain) characters appear: official pixiv CC0 heads (male heads blocked to avoid big-head-doll looks) + 4 pixiv CC0 bodies + 7 Quaternius CC0 outfit bodies (witch / ranger / knight-style / villager…, assigned by identity); other heads in old saves are shown as CC0 heads by seed (save unchanged). Off = also add the non-CC0 pack (private-use-only Genshin / MMD / VRoid Hub ones). Animations, scenes and props are CC0 anyway.', 'CC0モード：CC0モデルのみ（R38）', 'CC0（パブリックドメイン）のキャラだけが登場：pixiv公式CC0頭（男性頭は除外）＋pixiv CC0ボディ4体＋Quaternius CC0の職業服ボディ7体（魔女/レンジャー/騎士風/村娘など、身分に合わせて着用）。旧セーブの他の頭もシードでCC0頭に置換表示（セーブは不変）。オフで「非CC0パック」も追加（私的利用限定の原神/MMD/VRoid Hubモデル含む）。モーション・背景・小物は元々CC0。'],
head_collage: ['Collage mix: Genshin / MMD heads don’t wear their own hair (R38)', 'Every MMD / Genshin face gets another head’s hairstyle (accessories follow the hair), often plus a third head’s accessory — you can’t tell which original character it is. Only effective when “CC0 mode” is off (those heads don’t exist in CC0 mode).', 'コラージュ混成：原神/MMD頭は自前の髪を着けない（R38）', 'MMD/原神の顔すべてに別の頭の髪型を着せ（髪飾りは髪に付随）、さらに第三の頭の飾りを足すことも——元のキャラがわからなくなる。「CC0モード」オフの時のみ有効（CC0モードではこれらの頭は存在しない）。'],
skin_sss: ['Skin subsurface scattering · 3D lifelike (R36b)', 'On skin pixels only, adds on top of PBR: red scattering at the light-shadow terminator, warm fill on the backlit side, red translucency at grazing angles (ears / nostrils), suppressed plastic speculars plus a very faint oily sheen. Hair and clothes are unaffected; dark scenes aren’t lifted. Reload needed.', '肌の表面下散乱 · 3D実写質感（R36b）', 'PBRに肌ピクセルのみ追加：明暗境界の血色の散乱、逆光側の暖色フィル、掠め角の赤い透過縁（耳/鼻翼）、プラスチックの硬いハイライト抑制と極淡い脂の光沢。髪と服は影響なし、暗所は持ち上げない。要再読込。'],
head_pbr: ['Real lighting on heads (R33)', 'Heads / hair / eyes / accessories switch from the “toon material” (4 bands, no sky ambient, no light direction) to the same PBR as bodies: same lights, same environment map, same curve. Heads brighten and darken like bodies under sun / fire / shadow instead of staying murky. Reload needed. Off = old toon heads.', '首のリアルなライティング（R33）', '頭/髪/目/装飾を「トゥーンマテリアル」（4段階、空の環境光なし、光の向きに無反応）から体と同じPBRに変更：同じ灯り・同じ環境マップ・同じ曲線。日光/焚き火/影の下で体と同様に明暗が変わり、常に暗く灰色ではなくなる。要再読込。オフで旧トゥーン頭。'],
head_norm3: ['Slimmer head shape (R33)', 'After aligning face width / eye spacing to VRoid, shrinks non-VRoid heads another 5%, and further scales heads whose hair volume / accessories / beast ears enlarge the silhouette (hair bbox taller than the VRoid median), down to 82% at most. Reload needed.', '頭形をさらに一回り小さく（R33）', '顔幅/目間隔をVRoidに合わせた後、非VRoid頭全体をさらに5%縮小。髪量/髪飾り/獣耳でシルエットが大きい頭（髪のバウンディングボックスがVRoid中央値超）は比例して追加縮小、最大82%まで。要再読込。'],
body_headfit: ['Genshin body head-fit fix (R31)', 'The head scale on bodies was calibrated to VRoid bodies, so on Genshin bodies heads were 3–18% too small (Furina worst). Each Genshin body is corrected separately by height/head-height and head-width/shoulder-width; VRoid bodies unchanged.', '原神ボディの頭身比補正（R31）', '体に付ける頭の大きさはVRoidボディ基準で較正されており、原神ボディでは頭が3〜18%小さくなっていた（フリーナが最も顕著）。身長/頭高、頭幅/肩幅の2指標で原神ボディごとに補正。VRoidボディは変更なし。'],
head_qc: ['Weird head filter (R31)', 'Head models that still look odd after eyeballing and can’t be fixed yet (Yakumo Yukari, Kurotori) no longer spawn randomly or get lent out as hair. Owned ones are unaffected.', '異様な頭モデルの除外（R31）', '目視検査後も不自然で修正できない頭モデル（八雲紫、黒鳥）はランダム出現せず、髪型としても貸し出されない。所持済みは影響なし。'],
recall_iw: ['In-scene recall (R33)', 'F recall no longer opens a separate 3D screen: the camera pulls in inside the cave and the protagonist holds her in both hands for actions (gaze / stroke / sniff / whisper / that battle + handle: toss / spin / poke / pat). Heads don’t change expression; every action has a sound; info card and action bar redone.', '元の場面での回想（R33）', 'Fの回想は別の3D画面を開かず、洞窟内でカメラを寄せ、主人公が両手で首を抱えて動作（見つめる/撫でる/嗅ぐ/耳を寄せる/あの戦い＋弄ぶ：投げ受け/回す/つつく/叩く）。首は表情を変えず、各動作に効果音。情報カードと動作バーを刷新。'],
dev_mode: ['Developer mode (R34)', 'Unlimited resources (crystals / materials / potions auto-refill), all builds unlocked, invincible, infinite stamina; F8 or the DEV button (bottom-right) opens a panel: spawn heads (pick rarity), max gear tiers, max level, unlock all recalls. Off = normal play.', '開発者モード（R34）', 'リソース無限（魂晶/素材/薬が自動補充）、全建築解除、無敵、スタミナ無限。F8または右下のDEVボタンでパネル：首の生成（レア度指定可）、装備最大、レベル最大、全回想解放。オフで通常プレイ。'],
foe_abs: ['Absolute regional difficulty (R35)', 'Removes two safety nets: ① enemy damage no longer scales by your max-HP %, but uses absolute per-region values (deeper = more pain); ② removes the per-hit damage floor and “ordinary enemies die on the 6th hit”. Starter gear deep down gets one-shot — farm gear, level up.', '地域別の絶対難度（R35）', '2つの安全装置を撤廃：①敵のダメージは最大HPの%ではなく地域強度の絶対値（深いほど痛い）、②1撃ごとの最低ダメージと「通常の敵は6撃目で必ず死ぬ」を削除。初期装備で深部へ行くと瞬殺される——装備集めとレベル上げを。'],
hunters2: ['Four ogre hunters (R35)', 'Hero Erin, Tracker Nove, Oathkeeper Gwen, Mage Mia. The more people you down, the higher their hatred and the more they level (+1 per 15 hatred). While hunting, a full hunter sense may warp one into your map (not caves), sealing all doors; at 30% HP they flee and grow stronger if they escape. U shows levels / power gap / win chance.', 'オーガハンター4人（R35）', '勇者エイリン、追跡者ノヴェ、誓守グウェン、魔導士ミア。倒した人数が多いほど憎悪が上がり全員が成長（憎悪15ごとにLv+1）。狩り中にハンター感知が満ちると、あなたのいるマップ（洞窟除く）に出現し、全ての扉が封鎖される。HP30%で逃走し、逃げ切ると強化。Uでレベル/戦力差/勝率を確認。'],
elite_bosses: ['Elite challenges + Moon Witch (R35)', '13 elites (Circus Master / Pirate Queen / Plague Doctor / Arena Champion / Sand Queen / Clockwork Master / Alchemist Archduke / Thief Lord / Snake Mother / Valkyrie / Pharaoh Queen / Sword Saint / Giant Queen) + the final Moon Witch. Unlock via story conditions; see rumors, recommended power and win odds in the map or the U / Z tabs, then challenge them in a sealed arena.', 'エリート挑戦＋月の魔女（R35）', 'エリート13名（サーカス団長/海賊女王/ペスト医師/闘技場王者/砂海女王/からくり師/錬金大公/盗賊の主/蛇母/ヴァルキリー/女王ファラオ/剣聖/巨人の女王）＋最終ボス「月の魔女」。ストーリー条件で解放。探索マップ（出発先選択）やU/Zウィンドウのタブで噂・推奨戦力・予想勝率を確認し、封鎖された闘技場で挑戦。'],
victory2: ['New victory condition (R35)', 'Victory = any 7 regional overlords + 13 elites + 4 ogre hunters + the Moon Witch. Progress is at the top of the “Elite challenges” tab.', '新しい勝利条件（R35）', '勝利＝地域の覇者いずれか7名＋エリート13名＋オーガハンター4名＋月の魔女。進捗は「エリート挑戦」タブ上部。'],
gear2: ['Legendary-style gear (R35)', 'Adds 8 trinket slots (necklace / ring ×2 / bracer ×2 / belt / boots / medal) with 0–5 random affixes (damage %, crit, mitigation, heal, soul drain, crystals, hunter hatred…); each elite drops a unique mythic item. Gear can only be found outdoors — no longer bought with crystals (except backpacks). Z opens the paper-doll panel.', '伝説風装備（R35）', '装飾スロット8つ（首飾り/指輪×2/腕輪×2/ベルト/ブーツ/勲章）を追加。ランダムなアフィックス0〜5個（ダメージ%、会心、軽減、回復、魂吸収、魂晶、ハンター憎悪…）。エリートは各1つ専用の神話装備をドロップ。装備は野外でのみ入手可、魂晶では買えない（背負い籠を除く）。Zで着せ替え装備パネル。'],
hp_center: ['Big centre HP bar (R49d)', 'HP and soul energy sit at the bottom centre right above the hotbar: big numbers, white damage trail, red pulse at low HP and red screen edges. The small top-left frame stays.'],
memory: ['Memories: random pick-1-of-3 skills (R49)', 'Skill points become "awakened memories": 3 random cards from different schools (4 with the Mirror of Memory building, and the first reroll per pick is free). Pops up after trip settlement, or press E at the mirror. The talent tree is still available.'],
saga: ['Story cinematics: Anomalies + Moon clues (R49)', 'Every region entry opens a widescreen cinematic: subtitles + aerial / dolly / orbit camera work around a local "anomaly", randomly recombined every time. Main quest = slay the source; half of the anomalies are Moon Witch envoys that give clues; 7 clues unlock the Moon Witch. Chinese only (other languages keep the old arrival window).'],
arrival2: ['Arrival window (R35b)', 'Entering a location opens a big window: large regional art, typewritten arrival story / regional history / how locals see you / rumors, the main quest + 2 random side quests (rewards: crystals and trinkets) and a threat overview. Replaces the old 8-second small card.', '到着ウィンドウ（R35b）', '地点に入ると大きなウィンドウを表示：大きな地域イラスト、1文字ずつ表示される到着ストーリー/地域の昔話/住民の見方/噂、メインクエスト＋ランダム副クエスト2つ（魂晶と装飾品を報酬）、脅威一覧。従来の8秒の小カードを置換。'],
eye_white: ['Brighter eye whites (R24)', 'In dim cave firelight eye whites were crushed to grey-black. Now half lit, half self-lit: still white in the dark, never brighter than the face in the light.', '白目の明るさ補正（R24）', '洞窟の暗い火明かりで白目が灰黒になる問題を、半分は受光・半分は自己発光にして解決：暗所でも白く、明所では顔より明るくならない。'],
feel_bubble: ['Handling narration (R21)', 'Low-frequency typewriter captions describing how you’re toying with a head (its weight when lifted, how many meters thrown, how many bounces, stacking…). Third-person narration; heads don’t talk.', '弄び描写（R21）', '首の扱い方を描写する低頻度のタイプライター字幕（持ち上げた重さ、何メートル投げたか、何回弾んだか、積み上げ…）。三人称の語りで、首は喋らない。'],
feel_impact: ['Landing feel (R21)', 'Heads landing kick up dust rings by speed; sounds depend on the surface (stone thud / wood / soft on another head); hard nearby drops give the camera a light kick.', '着地の手応え（R21）', '首が着地すると速度に応じて塵の輪が舞い、着地面の素材で音が変わる（石の鈍音/木/他の首の上の柔らかい音）。近くでの激しい落下はカメラが軽く揺れる。'],
feel_heft: ['Sense of weight (R21)', 'Each head has its own heft: your hand dips when you lift it, it lags when you turn, bobs as you walk, and dips slightly when poked.', '重量感（R21）', '首ごとに重さがある：持ち上げると手が沈み、振り向くと遅れて揺れ、歩くと上下に揺れ、つつくとわずかに沈む。'],
smooth_faces: ['Smoothed head models', 'Smooths skin-mesh seam normals and softens toon shading steps; display only, save data untouched.', '頭モデルのスムージング', '肌メッシュの継ぎ目の法線を滑らかにし、トゥーン陰影の階段を和らげる。表示のみでセーブは変更しない。'],
headwear: ['Headwear', '14 detailed headwear types (bows, bunny ears, maid headdress, flower crowns…), rolled by identity.', '頭飾り', '14種の精緻な頭飾り（リボン、うさ耳、メイドカチューシャ、花冠…）を身分に応じて抽選。'],
cave_detail: ['Cave floor & small decor', 'Reduces rock-floor texture repetition and places CC0 props from the web (goblets, vases, lanterns, candlesticks, crates, barrels) with few InstancedMeshes; no extra per-item draw calls.', '洞窟の地面と小装飾', '岩肌テクスチャの繰り返し感を減らし、少数のInstancedMeshでネット上のCC0小物（杯、花瓶、ランタン、燭台、木箱、樽）を配置。個別のdraw callは増えない。'],
makeup: ['Makeup', 'Blush, beauty marks and freckles.', 'メイク', 'チーク、泣きぼくろ、そばかす。'],
breeze: ['Hair breeze', 'Hair always sways gently in the wind.', '髪のそよ風', '髪が常に風でわずかに揺れる。'],
species: ['Exotic-race materials', 'Slime girls (translucent jelly), ghosts, dolls (porcelain skin + joint lines), automata (panel lines + glow), statues, ice crystal, shadow — brand-new material races.', '異種族の質感', 'スライム娘（半透明ゼリー）、幽霊、人形（陶器肌＋関節線）、機娘（パネル線＋発光）、石像、氷晶、影など、まったく新しい質感の種族。'],
pupils: ['Special pupil patterns', 'Heart / star / slit / cross / petal / ring pupil patterns.', '特殊な瞳の模様', 'ハート/星/縦長/十字/花びら/リング状の瞳の模様。'],
stars: ['Quality stars', 'Each soul tier is split into ★1–★5 (low → supreme); output and gallery score vary with stars.', '品質の星', '各魂階を★1〜★5（下品→極品）に細分。産出と展示室スコアが星で変わる。'],
regions: ['New regions', 'Adds 8 new hunting grounds (a longer progression) and deeper cave levels.', '新地域', '新しい狩り場を8つ追加（より長い成長ライン）し、洞窟もさらに深く。'],
bigworld: ['A whole continent', 'No region picking: generates a huge 270-location map at the start for free exploration (off by default: each trip you pick a region and levels are random).', '大陸まるごと', '地域選択なし：開始時に270地点の巨大マップを生成し自由探索（初期はオフ：出発ごとに地域を選び、ステージはランダム生成）。'],
foe_bodies: ['Real-person enemies', 'Outdoor humans use their own VRM bodies and outfits, real animations, combat AI, ragdoll corpses, decapitation and dismemberment. Off = falls back to light-orb prey (saves memory).', '人型の敵', '野外の人物はそれぞれの元VRMの体・服装、本物のモーション、戦闘AI、ラグドール死体、斬首・欠損表現を使用。オフで光の玉の獲物に戻る（メモリ節約）。'],
forge: ['Soul Forge', 'Melts three heads into one higher-tier head.', '魂の溶鉱炉', '首3つを溶かして、より高階の首1つにする。'],
bowling: ['Soul Bowling', 'Throw heads at skull pins; hit them all for a STRIKE combo.', '魂ボウリング', '首をドクロのピンに投げる。全部倒せばSTRIKEのコンボ。'],
dresser: ['Dressing table', 'Change a head’s headwear, dye its hair, swap its expression. Requires “Headwear”.', '化粧台', '首の頭飾りの交換、髪染め、表情の変更ができる。「頭飾り」が必要。'],
worldgraph: ['Location-graph hunting (R14 · default)', 'Leaving the cave puts you in a randomly generated network of locations; each is a small explorable scene (sometimes a large one) with many doors; the deepest holds the regional overlord. Off = the old “click 60 times + on-screen UI panel” journey.', '地点グラフでの狩り（R14・標準）', '洞窟を出るとランダム生成された地点ネットワークへ。各地点は自由に歩き回れる小さな場面（時に大きな場面）で、多くの扉が他へ通じ、最深部に地域の覇者がいる。オフで旧「60回クリック＋画面UIパネル」の旅。'],
explore3d: ['First-person hunting (old · experimental)', '[Judged unacceptable in R11; off by default] Advance along a 3D regional road. Off = the “click 60 times + on-screen UI panel” journey.', '一人称の狩り（旧・実験）', '【R11でユーザーが不合格と判断、初期オフ】3D地域を道沿いに進む。オフで「60回クリック＋画面UIパネル」の旅。'],
oddities: ['Cabinet of Oddities', '7 new builds that put heads into everyday life: Tea Party of the Dead, Socialite Portrait Gallery (frames upgrade with soul tier), Grandma’s Rocking Chair, Hunt Memorial, Head Appraisal Desk (quality gacha), Dead-man Sofa Cinema (channel surfing), Head Vegetable Garden (water & harvest). All Poly Haven CC0 models.', '悪趣味な展示館', '首を日常生活に置く新建築7種：亡者のお茶会、名士の肖像廊（額縁は魂階で格上げ）、おばあちゃんの揺り椅子、狩首記念台、首の鑑定台（品質ガチャ）、亡者ソファ・シアター（チャンネル切替）、首の菜園（水やり・収穫）。すべてPoly Haven CC0モデル。'],
rites: ['Historical Rites', '7 head displays drawn from human history (50 slots total): Kubi-jikken table (Sengoku head inspection), Traitors’ Gate (London Bridge display), Shrunken-head workshop (tsantsa), Jingguan mound, Relic peddler (medieval relics & indulgences), Salome’s Feast, Headhunter drum (rhythm minigame).', '史録陳列', '人類の歴史に取材した首の陳列7種（計50枠）：首実検台（戦国の首検分）、反逆者の門（ロンドン橋の晒し）、縮み首工房（tsantsa）、京観、聖遺物商（中世の聖遺物と免罪符）、サロメの宴、首狩りの太鼓（リズムミニゲーム）。'],
curios: ['Head everyday objects · 6 new builds (R22)', 'Cuckoo clock (a head springs out to tell the hour, multiple strikes on the real hour), soul vending machine (heads as samples, dispenses materials), soul roulette (the wheel spins with heads, bet crystals), keys of the dead (seven heads by tier form a rising scale with resonance), sworn-brother altar (three heads test fate), gavel auction block (bids rise over time). Procedural models; heads don’t talk.', '首の日用品・新建築6種（R22）', 'カッコウ時計（首がバネで飛び出し時報、正時は連打）、魂の自販機（首を見本に素材を出す）、魂ルーレット（首を載せて回り魂晶を賭ける）、亡者の鍵盤（魂階順の7つの首が上昇音階で共鳴）、義兄弟の壇（3つの首で縁を占う）、木槌のオークション台（入札額が時間で上昇）。手続き生成モデル、首は喋らない。'],
organs: ['Corpse dissection · organ specimens (R22)', 'Corpse / beast-remains loot panels gain “🔪 Dissect”: take out heart, lungs, liver, kidneys, stomach, intestines, brain, eyeballs, tongue, spleen, gallbladder, spine, blood. Each organ has provenance (whose / race / tier / age / personality / inherited affix) and quality stats; bottle and display them in the cave for bonuses (3 from one person = set ×1.3; eyeballs follow you), or refine into soul dust. Only viscera / senses / bone / blood — no reproductive organs.', '遺体解剖・臓器標本（R22）', '遺体/獣骸の戦利品パネルに「🔪解剖」が出現：心臓、肺、肝臓、腎臓、胃、腸、脳、眼球、舌、脾臓、胆嚢、脊椎、血液を取り出す。臓器には由来（誰の/種族/魂階/年齢/性格/遺伝アフィックス）と品質の属性があり、瓶詰めして洞窟に飾るとボーナス（同一人物の3点で揃い×1.3、眼球はあなたを追う）。魂塵に精製も可。内臓・感覚器・骨・血のみで、生殖器官はなし。'],
props: ['Props · bone & sinew BUFF ornaments (R22)', 'The cave menu “🧷 Props” tab crafts 15 placeable props from finger bones, sinew, corpse wax, hair and ash (severed hand / foot taken from the character’s VRM body, stretchable gut rope, bone pile, bone blanket, blood-pact scroll, corpse-wax candle, ash urn, shield ornament, broken-blade stele, treasure chest, plus stretchable soul-tether, finger-bone wind chime, shroud banner chain, gem string). No collision or physics; place where the crosshair points; wheel rotates, Shift scales, Alt stretches, Ctrl raises, R tilts; E picks up, right-click takes back. Effects: nearby head output aura, poke bonus, stats, timed yields, chime resonance; stretching changes the range.', '小道具・骨と筋のBUFF飾り（R22）', '洞窟メニューの「🧷小道具」タブで、指骨・筋索・屍蝋・髪束・骨灰などの野外素材から置ける小道具15種を合成（切断された手・足（キャラの元VRMの体から取得）、伸縮自在の腸索、遺骨の山、砕骨の毛布、血の契約書、屍蝋燭、骨壺、盾飾り、折れ刃の碑、宝箱、さらに伸縮自在の牽魂線、指骨の風鈴、屍衣の幡鎖、宝石の連なり）。衝突・物理なし、照準の先に置ける。ホイールで回転、Shiftで拡縮、Altで伸縮、Ctrlで昇降、Rで傾き、Eで拾う、右クリックで回収。効果：付近の首の産出オーラ、つつきボーナス、ステータス、定時産出、風鈴の共鳴。伸縮で効果範囲が変わる。'],
books: ['Books & notes · name cross-check (R22)', 'Outdoor containers / corpses / overlords yield books and notes (diaries, wanted posters, last letters, gazetteers, overlord memoirs…) with character names highlighted. Reading frees the mouse; ✕ closes. In the cave you can “hold” one (T cycles names / Y reads), aim at a head whose name matches and left-click to cross-check — that head gains a new soul seal. 60% of names come from heads you own, 40% from living prey in this world; each name in a book can be checked once.', '書物とメモ・名前の照合（R22）', '野外の容器/遺体/覇者から書物やメモ（日記、手配書、遺書、地誌、覇者の手記…）が見つかり、文中の人名が色付けされる。読む間はマウス解放、✕で閉じる。洞窟では「手に持つ」ことができ（Tで名前切替/Yで閲覧）、名前の一致する首に向けて左クリックで照合すると、その首は新たな魂印を得る。名前の60%は所持の首、40%はこの世界の生きた獲物から。1冊につき1つの名前は1度だけ照合可。'],
item_3d: ['3D item icons', 'Weapons, shields, helmets, potions and materials in the sack / storage are rendered from CC0 3D models as icons (items without models stay emoji), with large pictures in the item menu. Slots are larger and adapt to screen size.', '3Dアイテムアイコン', '麻袋/収納箱の武器・盾・兜・薬・素材をCC0の3Dモデルでアイコン化（モデルのないものは絵文字のまま）、アイテムメニューに大きな画像。スロットも拡大し画面に合わせて調整。'],
beasts: ['Wild beasts (drop materials)', 'Wild locations spawn grey wolves (pack attacks, circling bites), red foxes (bite and run), bison (charge in a line, open after hitting a wall) and white-antler deer (flee, kick only when cornered). They drop no heads, only lootable carcasses: hide, raw meat, fangs, horns, for stew / whetstones / backpacks. Models: Quaternius CC0.', '荒野の野獣（素材ドロップ）', '荒野の地点に灰色狼（群れで襲い周回して噛みつく）、赤狐（噛んで逃げる）、野牛（直線突進、壁に当たると隙）、白角鹿（逃走、追い詰めると蹴る）が出現。首は落とさず、漁れる死骸（獣皮・生肉・牙・角）を残し、シチュー/砥石/背負い籠に合成可。モデルはQuaternius CC0。'],
ogre_level: ['Ogre leveling', 'Kills / decapitations / executions / perfect blocks and other combat events grant XP; leveling permanently raises Strength, Vitality, Agility, Menace, Soul and max HP, and restores some HP. Level shows in the hunt HUD and the cave stats page.', 'オーガのレベルアップ', '狩り中の撃破/斬首/処刑/パーフェクトガードなどで経験値を獲得。レベルアップで筋力・体力・敏捷・凶威・魂力と最大HPが永続的に上がり、HPも少し回復。狩りのHUDと洞窟のステータス画面にレベルを表示。'],
wgen: ['Location genome generator', 'Each hunting location derives a “genome” from a seed: sky (9 HDRIs mixed, any orientation) × lighting mood (golden dusk / morning mist / overcast / blood sunset / miasma / violet twilight / moonlit night) × season (lush / autumn / withered / frost…) × terrain archetype (hills / terraces / basin / ridge / dunes / plateau / crater / dry gully…) × streams & ponds × set dressing × ground tinting; only assets used by that location are downloaded (faster loading). Off = old maps.', '地点ゲノム生成器', '各狩り地点はシードから「ゲノム」を導出：空（9枚のHDRIを混用・任意の向き）×照明の雰囲気（黄金の夕暮れ/朝霧/曇天/血色の残照/瘴気/紫の黄昏/月夜）×季節（深緑/秋/枯れ/霜…）×地形原型（丘陵/棚田/盆地/稜線/砂丘/高台/クレーター/涸れ谷…）×小川・池×装飾×地表の色付け。その地点で使うアセットのみダウンロード（高速ロード）。オフで旧マップ。'],
wlayout: ['Map variety', 'Locations are no longer samey: irregular boundaries, varied terrain relief, paths worn between doors, clustered groves and clearings; random set pieces (abandoned camp / old battlefield / headhunter’s stakes / gnome court / megalith road / nameless altar); weather (rain / snow / fireflies / embers / ash / falling leaves / pollen / dust). Off = the old round clearing.', 'マップの多様化', '出発地点がワンパターンでなくなる：不規則な境界、起伏の違う地形、扉の間に踏まれた小径、房状の木立と林間の空き地。ランダムな装飾（廃キャンプ/古戦場/首狩りの杭/ノームの法廷/巨石の道/無名の祭壇）、天候（雨/雪/蛍/燃え殻/灰/落ち葉/花粉/砂埃）。オフで旧来の円形空き地。'],
spirits: ['Spirits (ancestors)', 'The souls of past cave-lords live here (cute little spirits): they chat, appraise heads, make wishes and play minigames; when all nine soul lamps are lit, a curse-breaking ritual begins. Hide them in the Spirit Book (Y).', '精霊（先祖）', '洞窟には歴代の洞主の魂（可愛い小さな精霊）が住む：おしゃべり、首の品評、願い事、ミニゲーム。9つの魂灯がともると呪い解きの儀式が行われる。精霊名簿（Y）で非表示にもできる。'],
spirit_sight: ['Spirit sight (N)', 'When on, you must press N to see the spirits in the cave (auto-enabled during story visits); off = spirits always visible. Requires the “Spirits” MOD.', '通神視点（N）', 'オンにすると、Nを押さないと洞窟の精霊が見えない（ストーリーの来訪時は自動オン）。オフで精霊は常に見える。「精霊」MODが必要。'],
chess: ['Head Chess Hall', 'Use heads as pieces: play Snik or two players on one screen.', '首のチェス殿', '首を駒にして、スニックと、または同じ画面で2人対戦。'],
rebirth: ['Rebirth Altar', 'Sacrifice a life for permanent Soul Core talents.', '輪廻の祭壇', '一つの生を捧げて、永続する魂核タレントを得る。'],
thief: ['Soul-thief raids', 'Soul thieves periodically come to steal heads; left-click to scatter them.', '魂泥棒の襲来', '魂泥棒が定期的に首を盗みに来る。左クリックで散らす。'],
surge: ['Soul Tide', 'At random, 20 seconds of ×3 output.', '魂潮', 'ランダムで20秒間、全産出が3倍。'],
ach: ['Achievements', '28 cross-rebirth achievements (J key).', '実績', '輪廻をまたぐ実績28個（Jキー）。'],
echo: ['Echo bubbles', 'Adjacent heads occasionally surface memory fragments and gain ×2 output.', '残響バブル', '隣り合う首がときおり記憶の断片を浮かべ、産出が2倍になる。'],
gesture_combat: ['Gesture combat', 'F draws / sheathes. Hold LMB and the mouse path controls the weapon in real time (rising / downward / horizontal slashes — faster = more damage); tap LMB to thrust; hold RMB to block (nudge the mouse to switch up/down/left/right). Head inspection moves to I.', 'ジェスチャー戦闘', 'Fで抜刀/納刀。左ボタンを押している間、マウスの軌跡で武器をリアルタイム操作（斬り上げ/斬り下ろし/横薙ぎ、速いほど高ダメージ）、左連打で突き、右押しでガード（マウスを軽く動かして上下左右を切替）。首の確認はIキーに変更。'],
crosshair_slash: ['Blade tip locked to crosshair (R18)', 'While holding LMB the blade tip stays at screen center; turning the view is the slash and the blade trail = the crosshair path. Off = the old “mouse controls weapon path”. Requires “Gesture combat”.', '刃先を照準に固定（R18）', '左ボタン押下中、刃先は画面中央に固定され、視点を回すことが斬撃になり、刃の軌跡＝照準の軌跡。オフで旧「マウスで武器の軌跡を操作」。「ジェスチャー戦闘」が必要。'],
talent_tree: ['Growth overhaul: attribute points + 6-school talent tree (R36)', '3 attribute points per level (Strength / Vitality / Agility / Menace / Soul, assigned by hand) + 1 skill point (plus bonus points for first overlord / elite kills). 6 schools (Bladedance · Iron Wall · Shadow Strike · Bloodrage · Soulcraft · Headhunter) with 78 nodes and 31 active skills; T opens the panel; recommended builds in one click. Off = the old “level-ups auto-add stats + Q/R/G skills”.', '成長システム刷新：属性ポイント＋6系統タレントツリー（R36）', 'レベルごとに属性ポイント3（筋力/体力/敏捷/凶威/魂力、手動配分）＋スキルポイント1（初撃破の覇者/エリートで追加）。6系統（刃舞・鉄壁・影襲・狂血・魂術・首狩り）計78ノード・31のアクティブスキル。Tでパネル、おすすめビルドはワンクリック。オフで旧「レベルアップで自動加算＋Q/R/G三スキル」。'],
talent_ui: ['WoW-style UI: big hotbar + portrait + target frame (R36)', 'Bottom 2 rows × 10 skill slots (1–0 / Shift+1–0, cooldown sweeps, dim when soul energy is short, drag to rearrange) + dodge / execute / potion quick slots; top-left player frame (HP / soul / stamina / XP / buffs) and target frame (enemy HP / affixes / bleeding & poison).', 'WoW風UI：大型ホットバー＋ポートレート＋ターゲット枠（R36）', '下部に2行×10マスのスキルバー（1-0 / Shift+1-0、クールダウン表示、魂力不足で暗転、ドラッグで入替）＋回避/処刑/薬のクイックスロット。左上にプレイヤー枠（HP/魂力/スタミナ/経験値/バフ）とターゲット枠（敵HP/アフィックス/出血・毒）。'],
foe_scale: ['Enemies scale with region (R34)', 'Enemy HP / damage / intelligence scale by “recommended power (region × rarity) ÷ your power”: starter gear in deep regions faces ×2.4 HP and ×3 damage, with hits-to-kill scaled to match; over-geared players aren’t paper (floor 0.9×). Off = every region’s enemies equally strong.', '地域に応じて敵が強化（R34）', '敵のHP/ダメージ/知能を「推奨戦力（地域×レア度）÷あなたの戦力」で拡縮：初期装備で深部へ行くと敵HP×2.4・ダメージ×3、必要な斬撃数も同比率で増える。装備過剰でも紙にはならない（下限0.9倍）。オフで全地域の敵が同じ強さ。'],
foe_pack: ['Enemy packs in the deep (R34)', 'Deeper regions put more enemies in a location (up to +2, cap 5).', '深部の敵の群れ化（R34）', '深い地域ほど1地点の敵が増える（最大+2、上限5体）。'],
foe_affix: ['Elite affixes (R34)', '7 elite affixes: Frenzied · Ironclad (shield layer) · Bloodthirsty · Explosive (blasts on death) · Shadowy (teleport ambush) · Chaining · Regenerating. More common deeper and at higher rarity; up to 2 stack; a glowing ring underfoot and an [Elite] marker overhead.', 'エリートアフィックス（R34）', 'エリート・アフィックス7種：狂熱・鉄壁（シールド層）・吸血・爆裂（死亡時に爆発）・幽影（瞬間移動の奇襲）・連斬・再生。深いほど・レアほど多く、最大2つ重複。足元に光の輪、頭上に【エリート】表示。'],
foe_skills: ['New enemy skills (R34)', 'Leaping slash (red landing circle, opening after landing) · Charge (red corridor, block useless) · Whirlwind (red circle underfoot) · Guard break (red glow = block useless, dodge only). All are telegraphed and leave an opening afterward.', '敵の新スキル（R34）', '跳躍斬り（赤い着地円、着地後に隙）・突進（赤い通路、ガード無効）・旋風斬（足元に赤い円）・防御崩し（赤い光＝ガード無効、回避のみ）。すべて予兆があり、終わると隙が生まれる。'],
foe_mind: ['Enemies read you (R37)', 'Enemies remember your habits (blocks a lot / swings wildly / circles / backs off) and counter them: too much blocking → red-glow guard break; wild swings → back off to bait a whiff then counter; circling → lateral prediction. Each enemy has a personality (patient / aggressive / tricky / counter), 1 of 6 attack rhythms (quick / normal / delayed / feint-then-quick / guard break / follow-up), and chains combos by your reactions. All new moves are telegraphed; damage numbers unchanged.', '敵があなたを読む（R37）', '敵はあなたの癖（ガード多用/乱振り/周回/後退）を覚えて対策：ガード過多→赤光の防御崩し、乱振り→後退して空振りを誘い反撃、周回→横方向の先読み。敵ごとに性格（忍耐/突進/詐術/反撃）があり、攻撃リズムは6種（速刀/通常/遅らせ/フェイント後速刀/防御崩し/追撃）から選び、あなたの反応に応じて連携。新技はすべて予兆あり、ダメージ数値は不変。'],
region_echo: ['Region echo: fame · relations · aftermath stories (R39)', 'Every region remembers you: fame title, relations with five powers (folk / arms / faith / arcane / noble), and aftermath stories of those you downed (kin mourn / avenge / fear / legend / memorial / legacy / succession). Each return shows an echo card and randomly grants crystals / regional materials / potions, and may add grudges or raise hunter hatred; next arrival, the region answers with offerings, warnings, gifts, followers or silence (again random resources or trouble). Always viewable in the region details of the location picker. Combat numbers unchanged.', '地域の反響：名声・関係・後日談（R39）', '各地域があなたを記憶する：名声の称号、民/武装/聖職/術士/貴族の五勢力との関係、倒した相手の「後日談」（親族の哀悼/復讐/恐怖/伝説/記念/遺産/後継）。帰還のたびに反響カードが出て、魂晶/地域素材/薬がランダムに入り、仇敵が増えたりハンター憎悪が上がることも。次の到着時には、供物・警告・贈り物・信者・沈黙で応える（やはり資源か厄介事がランダム）。地点選択画面の地域詳細でいつでも確認可。戦闘数値は不変。'],
tutorial: ['Tutorial (R37)', 'New saves start it automatically after the intro story; a small card at top-right (ZH / JA / EN) advances as you actually do things: look → walk → Snik / stats / build → go out → draw / slash / thrust / block / dodge → down / loot / retreat → carry sack / hold head / handle / recall / talents. Enter skips a step, F9 closes / reopens, and the title menu “📖 Tutorial” replays it. Never blocks play.', 'チュートリアル（R37）', '新規セーブは導入ストーリー後に自動開始。右上の小カード（中/日/EN）が、実際に操作すると進む：視点→歩行→スニック/ステータス/建築→外出→抜刀/斬撃/突き/ガード/回避→撃破/拾得/撤退→麻袋/首を持つ/弄ぶ/回想/タレント。Enterで1ステップ飛ばし、F9で閉じる/再開、タイトルメニューの「📖チュートリアル」で見直し可。プレイを妨げない。'],
ui_hub: ['Unified menu (R42)', 'Press Tab (cave or wilderness) for one main menu: a left rail groups Character / Challenges / Collection / World / System and switches between every screen; the paper-doll, inventory, smithy, workshop and codex are merged into one “Gear & Bag” page. The old hotkeys (T / O / F1 / C / U / K / L / B / Z…) still work and the rail appears with any panel. Off = the old scattered windows.', '統一メニュー（R42）', 'Tab（洞窟でも野外でも）でメインメニューを開く。左のレールがキャラクター／チャレンジ／コレクション／ワールド／システムに分かれ、画面を切り替えられる。装備ドール・持ち物・鍛冶・工房・典籍は「装備と持ち物」の1ページに統合。T/O/F1/C/U/K/L/B/Z などの従来キーもそのまま使え、どのパネルでもレールが出る。オフ＝従来のバラバラなウィンドウ。'],
skill_vfx: ['Skill effects (R45)', 'Casting a skill flashes the screen edge in the school colour, bursts a ring + sparks on its hotbar slot and shows a big icon + name banner; in 3D: sparks, a ground shockwave and a light pillar, plus school extras (crescent slashes / shield shell / soul-fire spiral / afterimage streaks); ultimates add a shockwave and screen shake. Number row and numpad 1–0 share the same skill bar; the bar also shows in the cave.', 'スキルエフェクト（R45）', 'スキル発動時、画面端が流派色に光り、スキル枠に光輪と火花、大きなアイコンと名前のバナーを表示。3Dでは火花・衝撃波・光柱、流派ごとに三日月の斬光／シールド／魂火の螺旋／残像線を追加。奥義は衝撃波と画面揺れ付き。数字キーとテンキーの1–0は同じスキルバーを共有。洞窟でもバーを表示。'],
world_master: ['Wilderness graphics master (R46)', 'A quality layer for the wilderness: large-scale terrain colour variation with anti-tiling, denser grass and shrubs (high tiers), softer higher-resolution shadows, region-specific air particles (pollen, dust motes, fireflies, ash and embers, snow) and per-region cinematic grading. Follows the quality tier and downgrades automatically on low FPS; switch it off if you dislike it.'],
map_shapes: ['Long & special-shaped maps (R46)', 'Wilderness maps are no longer one round clearing: long corridors, petals, crosses / stars, triangles / rectangles / hexagons, bent arms, S-shaped snake trails, long ovals... Doors open at the tips or corridor ends; foes, chests, props and landforms spread along every arm, and enemies chase you along the true boundary. Turn off to return to near-round maps.'],
terrain_master: ['Terrain character (R46)', 'Wilderness terrain is no longer a ring of gentle bumps: ridged-fractal relief plus 1-3 signature landforms per place (scarp / barrow / sunken cut / tors / plateau, seeded so even the same region differs); steep slopes get real rock textures (mossy rock in meadows, strata in the wilds, black rock in the abyss...), rocks grow on steep ground and grass/trees stay off it. Doors, shores and the spawn point stay flat. Turn off to return to the old terrain.'],
balance_r41: ['Weapon mastery / early balance (R43)', 'A clear novice-to-expert ladder: Novice (Lv1) → Apprentice (5) → Adept (10) → Expert (18) → Master (27). At Novice: windup ×2.2, swing ×1.6, recovery ×2.0, stamina ×1.5, only 45% damage; at Master: windup ×0.9, recovery ×0.85 — roughly 5× the output. See Tab → Character → Overview and the F draw toast; a banner shows on promotion. Also: low-tier regions hit harder, slower early levelling, more XP deeper down. Old saves keep their level.', '武技熟練／序盤バランス（R43）', '初心者から達人まで明確な段階：未熟(Lv1)→初級(5)→熟練(10)→達人(18)→宗師(27)。未熟時は予備動作×2.2・振り×1.6・硬直×2.0・スタミナ×1.5・ダメージ45%、宗師では予備動作×0.9・硬直×0.85で、総合火力は約5倍。Tab→キャラ→概要とF抜刀の表示で確認でき、昇格時に通知。低強度地域の敵は強く、序盤のレベルアップは遅め。旧セーブのレベルは維持。'],
hud_legible: ['Clearer HUD · bottom bar never covered (R40b)', 'When the hotbar is showing, every bottom-anchored prompt (E prompts, sack HUD, held book, spirit chip, key button…) is lifted above it so nothing overlaps; the full-width hint strip steps aside; the second hotbar row folds away when empty; hints/subtitles get darker plates and larger text; the F draw-weapon toast becomes one short line. No gameplay effect.', '見やすいHUD・下部バーを隠さない（R40b）', 'ホットバー表示中は、画面下の各種ヒント（Eヒント・麻袋HUD・手持ちの本・霊契・キーボタンなど）をバーの上に自動で持ち上げ、重ならないようにする。下部の横長ヒントは退避、2段目が空なら折りたたみ、ヒントや字幕は暗い下地と大きめの文字に。Fの抜刀メッセージは1行に短縮。ゲームプレイには影響なし。'],
keyguide: ['Key Guide (R40)', 'F1 or ? opens / closes it; also via the title menu “⌨ Key Guide” and the small “Keys F1” button at bottom-right. Trilingual (ZH / JA / EN); keys you press light up in the panel. No effect on gameplay.', 'キー一覧（R40）', 'F1または?で開閉。タイトルメニューの「⌨キー一覧」や右下の小さな「キー F1」ボタンからも開ける。中/日/EN対応、押したキーがパネル上で光る。ゲームプレイには影響なし。'],
foe_tactics: ['Enemy tactics layer (R34)', 'You whiff → instant counter; you flail → sidestep-roll then counter; you turn your back → ambush; they deliberately delay / chain attacks to break your “wind-up → parry” rhythm.', '敵の戦術層（R34）', 'あなたが空振り→即反撃、乱振り→横転で避けて反撃、背を向ける→奇襲、わざと間を遅らせる/連続で攻撃してあなたの「予備動作→パリィ」のリズムを崩す。'],
foe_roles2: ['More enemy types (R26)', 'Duelist (blocks and counters the moment you swing) · Heavy guard (light frontal hits useless — go behind / finisher / heavy slash) · Sorcerer (soulfire ball, can be scattered / dodged / blocked; teleports if you get close) · Healer (heals allies — kill first) · Standard-bearer (allies in the red circle are faster and fiercer; at half HP a war cry sends everyone charging). Requires “Enemy roles”. Off = only the original 6.', '敵タイプの追加（R26）', '決闘者（刃を出した瞬間にガード反撃）・重装衛兵（正面の軽攻撃は無効——背後/トドメ/重斬）・術士（魂火球、散らす/避ける/ガード可、近づくと瞬間移動）・治癒師（味方を回復、優先撃破）・戦旗手（赤い円内の味方が速く強くなり、HP半分で鬨の声を上げて全員突撃）。「敵の職業」が必要。オフで元の6種のみ。'],
foe_roles3: ['More enemy types · batch 3 (R37)', 'Spearman (straight thrust along a ground red line, stumbles on a miss) · Twin-blade dancer (quick chain slashes then a back-hop, sidesteps) · Alchemist bomber (incendiary flasks with an orange-circle warning) · Netter (nets you 1.3 s; cut or block it) · Trapper (bear traps) · Summoner (chasing will-o’-wisps, can be scattered).', '敵タイプの追加・第3弾（R37）', '槍兵（地面の赤い線に沿った直線突き、外すとよろめく）・双刀の舞姫（素早い連斬のあと後跳び、横に避ける）・錬金投弾手（オレンジの円で予告される燃える薬瓶）・網使い（1.3秒捕縛、斬る/ガードで解除）・罠師（トラバサミ）・召霊師（追ってくる鬼火、散らせる）。'],
combat_master: ['Master-level combat (R26)', 'Tap LMB to swing instantly, tap 3× for a combo (heavier finisher), hold and flick the mouse to cut that way, hold still and release for a guard-breaking heavy slash; hits count when the blade reaches the target inside the view cone (no more whiffs from tip-vs-bone checks) — the crosshair on head / neck / leg hits there; hits bring camera push / roll / FOV punch / blade recoil and restore stamina. Off = the old charged-swing gesture.', 'マスター級戦闘（R26）', '左クリックで即座に斬り、3連打で三連斬（トドメは重い）、押して振るとその方向に斬り、止めて離すと防御崩しの重斬。判定は視野錐内で刃が届けば命中（刃先と骨の当たり判定による空振りなし）、照準が頭/首/脚を指せばそこに当たる。命中でカメラの押し込み/傾き/FOVの衝撃/刃の反動、スタミナ回復。オフで旧「溜め振りジェスチャー」。'],
atk_cd: ['Attack cooldown (R26)', 'Light slash 0.5 s, 3-hit finisher 0.75 s, heavy slash 0.95 s before the next swing (longer for heavy weapons, +30% when exhausted). LMB during cooldown buffers a swing that fires the instant it’s ready. A thin arc around the crosshair shows cooldown progress. Off = no-cooldown chaining.', '攻撃クールダウン（R26）', '軽斬り0.5秒、三連トドメ0.75秒、重斬0.95秒で次の斬撃が可能（重武器は長め、力尽き時+30%）。クールダウン中の左クリックは1撃分バッファされ、準備できた瞬間に発動。照準の外周の細い弧でクールダウン進行を表示。オフでクールダウンなしの連斬。'],
wsites: ['Special locations: crowds & gatherings (R41)', 'Some locations become gatherings: market day / capital night market (vendors at stalls, buyers haggling), bonfire night (sitting in a circle, crouching to warm hands, drinking), pilgrim gathering (kneeling faithful, a prayer leader, torch-bearing guards), witches’ sabbath (chanting around a green-glowing cauldron), refugee camp (small fires, lantern watch), fighting ring (two sparring, a ring of spectators), woodcutters’ camp (axes on every side). 5–8 people each at their post; the door sign shows it from the other side. More people = more heads and loot (extra chest), but one who spots you wakes everyone nearby: the brave charge, the timid scatter. Off = no gatherings.', '特殊地点：人の集まる場所（R41）', '一部の地点が集会になる：市の日/王都の夜市（露店の店主、値切る客）、焚き火の夜会（輪になって座る・しゃがんで暖を取る・酒を飲む）、巡礼の集い（跪く信徒・祈祷の先導者・松明の護衛）、魔女の宴（緑に光る大鍋を囲んで詠唱）、流民の野営地（小さな焚き火・ランタンの見張り）、闘技の輪（二人の手合わせと観衆）、木こりの野営地（あちこちで斧の音）。5〜8人がそれぞれの持ち場に。扉の札で向こう側から分かる。人が多い＝首も戦利品も多い（宝箱追加）が、一人に見つかると周囲全員が目を覚ます：勇敢な者は突進し、臆病な者は散り散りに逃げる。オフで集会なし。'],
hud_bottom: ['Hints at the bottom + smaller skill bar (R41)', 'The control hint line in the wilds/cave is no longer lifted above the skill bar into your view; it becomes a thin line at the very bottom. The default wilds hint drops the long combat explanation (see F1). Skill slots are ~20% smaller. Off = R45 layout.'],
weak_starter: ['Weaker starter weapon (R41)', 'The starting crude club deals only 60% damage, so your first real weapon (spiked club and up) feels clearly stronger. Off = normal club damage.'],
wpn_stats: ['Weapon base stats (R41)', 'Every weapon has its own real stats: windup, swing, recovery, stamina cost, reach, guard-break chance, crit chance/damage, cutting (neck damage), knockback, block stamina cost and perfect-parry window. Off = old single weight formula.'],
wpn_mastery: ['Per-weapon mastery (R41)', 'The Novice→Master windup/recovery/stamina/damage ladder is trained per weapon: +1 per hit, +6 per kill, +10 per decapitation/execution with that weapon. New weapons start at Novice. Off = based on character level (R43).'],
wfix41: ['Map generation fixes (R41)', 'Fixes a batch of crude issues in random locations: a sight corridor at every entrance (mounds no longer block the view right at the door), mounds no longer sit dead centre, the lower sky blends into the fog (the far terrain edge no longer looks like a cardboard wall, and ground objects in the sky photos are hidden), the modern street photo is no longer used as a sky, and light shafts no longer turn into bright hairlines when seen edge-on. Off = old generation.', '地図生成の修正（R41）', 'ランダム地点の粗い問題をまとめて修正：入口ごとの視線回廊（塚が入口の真正面を塞がない）、塚が中央に居座らない、空の下端が霧に溶ける（遠景の地形の縁が段ボールの壁に見えず、空写真の地上物も隠れる）、現代の街並み写真を空に使わない、光の筋が真横から見て細い光線にならない。オフで旧生成。'],
region_beasts: ['Regional monsters (R41)', 'Each region has its own set of cute wild monsters: cluck-dumplings, carrot bunnies and watchdogs in the village; mushlings, the Mushroom King and armoured bees in the elf forest; cactus toughs, little tyrant-rexes and flying alpacas in the wilds; bedsheet ghosts and pointy-hat wizards at the abbey; blobs, frog kings and jellyfish in the swamp; orcs and gargoyle imps at the fortress; cat-balls, little ninjas and fat pigeons in the capital; trident demons, bat imps and dragonlings in the abyss; yetis, snowballs and crested dragons on the peak. Flyers hover in the air. They drop regional materials. Off = old wolves/foxes/bison/deer everywhere. Models: Quaternius Ultimate Monsters (CC0). Needs “Wild beasts” on.', '地域の野良モンスター（R41）', '地域ごとに固有のかわいい野良モンスターが出現：村のコケ団子/ニンジンうさぎ/番犬、精霊の森のキノコっ子とキノコ大王・鎧バチ、荒野のサボテン男/ちびティラノ/空飛ぶアルパカ、修道院のシーツおばけととんがり帽子の魔法使い、沼のスライム/カエル王/クラゲ、要塞のオークと小ガーゴイル、王都の猫玉/ちび忍者/太った鳩、深淵の三叉魔/コウモリ小悪魔/子竜、聖山の大雪男/雪玉/冠羽飛竜。飛ぶものは宙に浮く。地域素材を落とす。オフで旧来の狼/狐/野牛/鹿が全域に。モデルはQuaternius Ultimate Monsters（CC0）。「荒野の野獣」が必要。'],
region_econ: ['Regional material economy + overlord head synthesizer (R26k)', 'Building / digging deeper / enchanting +2 and up / high-tier backpacks and regen potions all need materials scavenged from each region (each of 9 regions has a common + a rare one: straw, laurel, wolf bristle, holy water, swamp muck, fortress steel, capital silk, abyss obsidian, dragon scale…) — crystals alone aren’t enough. Each location has 1–3 extra gathering spots; enemies / containers / beasts drop local materials, overlords the most. Slaying a regional overlord unlocks that region’s “Overlord Head Synthesizer”: it accepts only her head and slowly turns crystals into local common materials; press E empty-handed to supervise. Off = crystals only.', '地域素材経済＋覇者の首の合成器（R26k）', '建築/掘り下げ/+2以上の付呪/高級背負い籠と再生薬には、各地域で集めた素材が必要（9地域それぞれに通常＋レアの2種：藁、月桂樹の枝、狼の剛毛、聖水、沼の黒泥、要塞の精鋼、王都の絹、深淵の黒曜、竜鱗…）。魂晶だけでは足りない。各地点に採集ポイントが1〜3か所増え、敵/容器/獣も現地素材を落とし、覇者が最多。地域の覇者を倒すとその地域の「覇者の首の合成器」が解放：彼女の首だけを受け付け、魂晶をゆっくり現地の通常素材に変換。素手でEを押して督促。オフで魂晶のみ。'],
head_support: ['Heads never float (R26l)', 'For every head-display build, probes the model surface below each slot so the head rests exactly on the table / spike / barrel rim; over liquid it sinks in slightly. Off = each build’s original hand-set heights.', '首が宙に浮かない（R26l）', '首を置く建築すべてで、各位置の下のモデル表面を探査して、首が台/杭/樽の縁にぴったり乗る。下が液体なら少し浸かる。オフで各建築の元の手動設定の高さ。'],
region_pick: ['Map-card location picker (R26m)', 'Going out hunting becomes a preview image on the left + regional dossier on the right: overlord, two mini-bosses, residents, specialties, arrival quest — one click to set out. Off = the old card list.', 'マップカードで地点選択（R26m）', '狩りに出る画面が、左にプレビュー画像・右に地域ファイル（覇者、中ボス2名、住人、特産、到着後のクエスト）の形になり、ワンクリックで出発。オフで旧カード一覧。'],
region_quest: ['Arrival brief + quest + mini-bosses (R26m)', 'Entering a region shows a non-blocking briefing card and gives a quest (slay mini-boss / decapitate / down / slay overlord) rewarding crystals and regional materials. Each region has two named mini-bosses, permanently recorded once slain.', '到着ブリーフィング＋クエスト＋中ボス（R26m）', '地域に入ると操作を妨げないブリーフィングカードが出て、クエスト（中ボス討伐/斬首/撃破/覇者討伐）を受け、魂晶と地域素材を報酬として得る。各地域に名前付きの中ボスが2名、討伐すると永久に記録される。'],
ogre_hunters: ['Ogre hunters (R26n)', 'The longer you down / decapitate / linger in a region, the higher the tracking heat; when full, after a 15-second countdown you’re dragged into a generated “Hunter Pen” and the door opens only when all hunters are dead. Each time you survive, the next wave is bigger and stronger.', 'オーガハンター（R26n）', '地域で倒す/斬首する/長く留まるほど追跡熱が上がり、満ちると15秒のカウントダウン後に生成された「ハンターの囲い場」へ引きずり込まれ、ハンター全滅で扉が開く。生き残るたび、次の波はより多く強くなる。'],
release_slash: ['Charged release slash (R22)', 'After drawing, hold LMB to charge (view follows 1:1, blade pulls back against your drift, direction line by the crosshair); release to capture the mouse’s tiny drift and swing that way (snaps to 8 directions within 14°). No drift: short press = thrust, full 0.7 s charge = straight chop. The blade tip itself doesn’t hurt while held. Off = R18 “blade tip locked to crosshair”.', '溜め斬り（R22）', '抜刀後、左ボタン押し＝溜め（視点は1:1で追従、刃は「傾向」と逆向きに引かれ、照準横に方向線が出る）。離すと離す直前のマウスの微細な傾向を捉え、その方向に一閃（14°以内は8方向にスナップ）。傾向がなければ短押し＝突き、0.7秒満タン＝真っ直ぐ斬り下ろし。押している間の刃先は攻撃判定なし。オフでR18の「刃先を照準に固定」。'],
forge_buy: ['Smithy: buy upgrades with crystals (R22)', '[Off by default, R26] On = the smithy sells the next gear tier for crystals (old rule). Off = gear can only be scavenged outdoors (enemies / corpses / containers / overlords), and crystals only enhance gear you own (weapons / helmets / armor / charms, +1 to +10).', '鍛冶台：魂晶で直接昇格（R22）', '【初期オフ、R26】オンで鍛冶台が魂晶で次の階の装備を購入可（旧ルール）。オフで装備は野外での入手のみ（敵/遺体/容器/覇者）、魂晶は所持装備の強化（武器/兜/鎧/護符を+1〜+10）にだけ使う。'],
combat_fx: ['Combat SFX & hit feedback (R22)', 'A full procedural combat sound set: blade whoosh (by force / direction / stereo), thrust, whiff, charge rising pitch and full-charge cue, flesh / neck / bone / heavy hits, decapitation spray, kill low-end, parry / block / guard break / perfect block, dodge, damage thud with tinnitus, enemy wind-up growls and warnings, enemy footsteps and swings (positional); hit crosshair (white = hit, yellow = weak point, red = kill, blue = blocked) and light screen shake. Off = old sampled sounds.', '戦闘効果音と命中フィードバック（R22）', '手続き合成の戦闘音一式：刃の風切り（力/方向/左右定位）、突き、空振り、溜めの音程上昇と満タン合図、肉/首/骨/重撃の命中、斬首の噴血、撃破の低音、弾き/ガード/防御崩し/パーフェクトガード、回避、被弾の鈍音と耳鳴り、敵の予備動作の咆哮と警告、敵の足音と攻撃の風切り（方位付き）。命中クロスヘア（白＝命中、黄＝弱点、赤＝撃破、青＝ガードされた）と軽い画面振動。オフで旧サンプル音。'],
aim_assist: ['Slash aim assist (R22)', 'Fewer whiffs: on swing, auto-picks the nearest enemy in the view cone and routes the blade through their chest; extends blade reach and steps forward slightly for enemies 2 m away; hit detection is a bit lenient; whiffs get a sound and hint. Doesn’t affect your view (no camera stickiness).', '斬撃エイムアシスト（R22）', '空振りを減らす：斬る際に視野錐内の最も近い敵を自動選択して刃が胸を通るように。2m離れた敵には刃の有効射程を自動延長して小さく踏み込む。命中判定は体にやや寛容、空振りには音とヒント。視点には影響しない（カメラの吸着なし）。'],
foe_roles: ['Enemy roles (R22)', 'Enemies no longer share one routine: Brute (high HP / slow / heavy hits / shrugs off light hits) · Skirmisher (dash slash then step back / roll dodge) · Shieldbearer (always guarding — go behind or charge to break) · Assassin (stealth flank, backstab ×1.6, audio cue) · Berserker (combos, enrage at half HP) · Thrower (ranged blades, can be blocked / batted away). The role name shows overhead on first sight. Off = one logic for all.', '敵の職業（R22）', '敵は1つのパターンではなくなる：蛮兵（高HP/鈍足/重撃/軽攻撃に耐える）・遊撃（突進斬りから後退/ローリング回避）・盾衛（常にガード、背後か溜め攻撃で崩す）・刺客（潜行して背後へ、背刺し×1.6、合図音あり）・狂戦士（連撃、HP半分で狂暴化）・投擲手（遠距離の投刃、ガード/弾き落とし可）。初見時に頭上へ職業名を表示。オフで全員同じロジック。'],
swing_momentum: ['Swing momentum (R21)', 'Damage depends on how continuous the swing is: waggling left-right does almost nothing; big true cuts / thrusts / charges hurt. A thin bar under the crosshair shows current momentum.', '斬撃の勢い（R21）', 'ダメージは一振りの連続した振り幅で決まる：左右に小さく揺らすだけではほぼ無傷、大きく振り切った斬撃/突き/溜めが効く。照準下の細いバーで現在の勢いを表示。'],
foe_smart: ['Smarter enemies (R21)', 'Predictive interception, sprinting pursuit, flanking formations, a dash slash when you turn to flee, retreating to regroup when badly hurt, searching your last known position when they lose sight; they route around trees and rocks and auto-detour when stuck.', '賢い敵（R21）', '先読みの迎撃、全力疾走の追撃、複数での包囲配置、背を向けて逃げると突進斬り、重傷なら下がって立て直し、見失うと最後の位置を捜索。木や岩を避けて回り込み、詰まると自動で迂回。'],
foe_door_escape: ['Prey escape through doors (R21)', 'Fleeing prey runs for the nearest door and truly escapes once it reaches it (you won’t get her head this time).', '獲物が扉から逃げる（R21）', '逃走する獲物は最寄りの扉へ走り、扉に着くと本当に逃げ切る（今回は彼女の首は手に入らない）。'],
ranks: ['Rank system · 12 lines, 36 schools (R27)', 'Name and soul tier always show; each character also has a “rank”: by identity, 12 lines (Battle / Hunt / Clergy / Nature / Arcane / Hex-shadow / Craft-medic / Artist / Royal / Abyss / Dragon-vein / Folk), each with 3 schools and 10 ranks (288 titles in all); the same identity may walk another school; higher soul tier = higher rank. The full rank chart is on the profile card.', '階位システム・12系統36流派（R27）', '名前と魂階は常に表示。各キャラには別途「階位」があり、身分ごとに戦陣/狩猟/聖職/自然/奥術/呪影/匠医/芸者/王権/深淵/竜脈/民間の12系統、各系統3流派・10階（計288の称号）に分かれる。同じ身分でも別の流派に進むことがあり、魂階が高いほど階位も高い。プロフィールカードに完全な階位表あり。'],
overhear: ['Eavesdrop on arrival (R27)', 'Entering a populated location pops a dialogue box on the left (no freeze, auto-fades): they chat by personality and relationship (same line / rank gap / peers) — work, wishes, faith, rumors about you, little habits; what they say reveals info about them (counted as already recalled) and is logged in the trip log.', '到着時の盗み聞き（R27）', '人のいる地点に入ると左側に会話ボックス（停止せず自動で消える）：彼女たちは性格と関係（同系統/上下の階位/同業）に応じて、仕事・願い・信仰・あなたの噂・ちょっとした癖を語る。話から情報が分かり（回想済み扱い）、行程ログにも記録される。'],
recall: ['Recall / nameless heads (R25)', 'A newly severed head only shows rarity and origin; press F to hold her up and “recall”: gaze, stroke, sniff, whisper, recall that fight… gradually remembering personality, looks, identity, faith, name, life story. Altars / dressing tables / forges / chessboards unlock more actions. Off = every head shows full info.', '回想／無名の首（R25）', '斬ったばかりの首はレア度と産地しかわからない。Fで目の前に抱えて「回想」：見つめる、撫でる、嗅ぐ、耳を寄せる、あの戦いを思い出す……少しずつ性格・外見・身分・信仰・名前・生涯を思い出す。祭壇/化粧台/鍛冶台/チェス盤などの建築でさらに動作が解放。オフで全ての首が完全な情報を表示。'],
stamina_all: ['Unified stamina (R25)', 'Attacking, blocking, sprinting, jumping and dodging share one stamina bar; at zero you’re exhausted — you can do nothing but walk slowly, the weapon droops, the screen reddens, until you recover.', '統一スタミナ（R25）', '攻撃・ガード・ダッシュ・ジャンプ・回避が1本のスタミナを共有。尽きると力尽き——ゆっくり歩く以外何もできず、武器は垂れ、画面は赤くなり、休むまで回復しない。'],
sprint_stamina: ['Sprinting costs stamina (R21)', 'Shift-sprinting drains stamina each second; at zero you must catch your breath before sprinting again — enemies can catch you.', 'ダッシュでスタミナ消費（R21）', 'Shiftダッシュは毎秒スタミナを消費し、尽きると息を整えるまで再ダッシュ不可——敵に追いつかれる。'],
persona: ['Personas (R24)', 'Each enemy talks by personality (proud / calm / gentle / timid / bellicose / sharp-tongued / cunning / cheerful), decides fight-or-flee, retreats or not, nods / shakes head / folds arms in standoffs; unaware of you, they go about their business (working, patrolling, lurking, chatting in pairs); a [Personality · Role] name pops up on first sight.', 'ペルソナ（R24）', '敵は性格（高慢/冷静/優しい/臆病/好戦的/毒舌/狡猾/明朗）ごとに違う台詞を話し、戦うか逃げるか・撤退するかも変わり、対峙時にうなずく/首を振る/腕組みをする。あなたに気づいていない間は各自の行動（作業/巡回/待ち伏せ/2人で雑談）。初見時に【性格・職業】の名前が表示される。'],
persona_voice: ['Persona voices (R24)', 'Real-person enemy voices: lines, attack shouts, pain cries, a last word on falling; each has a slightly different pitch, with direction and distance. Requires “Personas”.', 'ペルソナボイス（R24）', '敵の実際の人声：台詞、攻撃の掛け声、苦痛の声、倒れる間際の最後の一言。人ごとに声の高さが少し違い、方位と距離感あり。「ペルソナ」が必要。'],
footsteps: ['Footsteps (R24)', 'Your steps are heavy and vary by ground (grass / leaves / gravel / flagstone / mud / snow / cave); enemies have lighter steps you can place by direction and distance, denser and louder when running; shieldbearers and brutes clink with armor plates, assassins go silent once locked on you.', '足音（R24）', 'あなたの足音は重く、地面（草/落ち葉/砂利/石畳/泥/雪/洞窟）で変わる。敵は軽快な足音で方位・距離がわかり、走ると密で大きくなる。盾衛と蛮兵は装甲板の金属音、刺客はあなたを捉えると無音になる。'],
face_light: ['Face fill light (R24)', 'Like a game-character fill light: a soft light from your view direction onto faces (and a little on body / hair), so faces don’t go black when backlit / overcast / at night.', '顔の補助光（R24）', 'ゲームのキャラ補助光のように、視線方向から顔（と体・髪に少し）へ柔らかい光を当てる。逆光・曇り・夜でも顔が真っ黒にならない。'],
hit_hud: ['Hit HUD: merged damage numbers + enemy health bars (R26)', 'Repeated hits on one target show one cumulative number (with ×N combo count, bouncing each hit) instead of a number per blow; hit enemies and beasts show a health bar overhead (white = just lost), so you can see how many hits remain.', '命中HUD：ダメージ数値の統合＋敵HPバー（R26）', '同じ相手への連続ヒットは累計の1つの数字（×N連撃数付き、ヒットごとに弾む）で表示し、1撃ごとの数字が画面を埋めなくなる。被弾した敵と獣の頭上にHPバー（白＝直前に減った分）が出て、あと何撃か分かる。'],
audio_mixer: ['Volume mixer panel (R26)', 'Top-right 🔊 / menu “🔊 Volume”: master, music, combat SFX, voices, ambience, footsteps and UI adjusted separately (0–150%, auto-saved). Music defaults to half of before. Off = the old single BGM switch and fixed volume.', '音量ミキサーパネル（R26）', '右上の🔊/メニューの「🔊音量」：全体、音楽、戦闘音、ボイス、環境音、足音、UIを個別に調整（0〜150%、自動保存）。音楽の初期値は以前の半分。オフで旧来の単一BGMスイッチと固定音量。'],
hit_impact: ['Hit impact boost: hit-stop + slash marks + heavy thud (R26)', 'On a hit the victim’s animation freezes 60–150 ms (the pause of cutting into flesh; your camera and controls don’t freeze); a blade streak sweeps along the swing (wider / redder for heavy slashes / kills, yellow sparks on blocks); a low-end thud layer; red screen-edge pulse on a kill.', '打撃感強化：ヒットストップ＋斬痕＋重撃の鈍音（R26）', '命中時、斬られた側のアニメが60〜150ms停止（肉に食い込む間。あなたのカメラと操作は止まらない）。振りの方向に刃光が走り（重斬/撃破は太く赤く、ガードは黄色い火花）、低音の鈍い衝撃音を重ね、撃破時は画面端が赤く脈打つ。'],
ambience: ['Ambience (R24)', 'A soundscape per location: wind, leaves, birdsong, woodpeckers, owls, crickets, frogs, crows, distant wolf howls, flags, far bells, dripping water, muffled thunder; caves get low rumbles and drips. All synthesized live; fades out when paused / in menus.', '環境音（R24）', '地点ごとのサウンドスケープ：風、木の葉、鳥のさえずり、キツツキ、フクロウ、コオロギ、蛙、カラス、遠くの狼の遠吠え、旗、遠い鐘、水滴、鈍い雷。洞窟は低い唸りと水滴。すべてリアルタイム合成、一時停止/メニュー中は自動でフェードアウト。'],
guard_slowlook: ['Slower look while blocking (R19)', 'Holding RMB to block slows view turning (×0.45) to steady your stance; not while slashing.', 'ガード中の感度低下（R19）', '右ボタンでガード中は視点の回転が遅くなる（×0.45）。構えを安定させる。斬撃中は下がらない。'],
wpn_feel: ['Slower look while blocking', 'Holding RMB to block lowers look sensitivity to ×0.3 (off = back to the old ×0.45 or none). R22 removed the “weapon inertia” while holding LMB: the view follows 1:1 while LMB is held.', 'ガード中の感度低下', '右ボタンでガード中の視点感度を×0.3に下げる（オフで旧×0.45または低下なし）。R22で左ボタン押下中の「武器の慣性」は撤廃：左押し中は視点が1:1で追従。'],
loc_story: ['Location intro story card (R20)', 'On first entering each location, freezes and shows an encounter intro card (you can retreat). Removed at the user’s request in R21 → off by default.', '地点入場ストーリーカード（R20）', '各地点に初めて入る際、停止して遭遇紹介カードを表示（撤退可）。R21でユーザーの要望により撤廃→初期オフ。'],
sack_grid: ['Sack grid · scavenging economy (R19)', 'The sack becomes a grid inventory (items occupy cells by shape, heads 2×2; Tab / B opens; drag to arrange, R rotates). Looting outdoors takes 0.6–2 s per item put in / taken out (heads 2.2 s), interrupted by hits; dumping the bag empties it instantly. Weapons & gear can only be scavenged outdoors (crates / barrels / weapon racks / corpses / overlords); crystals are only for enchanting and crafting. Off = the old “sack holds N heads” + shop buying.', '麻袋グリッド・漁り経済（R19）', '麻袋がグリッド式の持ち物に：アイテムは形に応じてマスを占め（首は2×2）、Tab/Bで開き、ドラッグで整理、Rで回転。野外で漁る際は1点の出し入れに0.6〜2秒（首は2.2秒）かかり、被弾で中断。袋を空けると一瞬で全部出る。武器・装備は野外（木箱/樽/武器架/遺体/覇者）でのみ入手、魂晶は付呪と素材合成にのみ使う。オフで旧「麻袋にN個の首」＋店で購入。'],
worldlay: ['Location layout archetypes (R18)', 'Hunting locations are no longer random tree scatter: campfire camp, forest clearing, lakeside pier, ruined courtyard, stone-circle plateau, canyon path, abandoned market — with terrain relief and enemy formations.', '地点レイアウト原型（R18）', '狩り地点はもはや木のランダム配置だけではない：焚き火のキャンプ、林間の空き地、湖畔の桟橋、崩れた中庭、環状列石の高台、峡谷の小径、廃市場——起伏のある地形と敵の陣形つき。'],
film: ['Film mode', 'P key: free-flight camera.', 'シネマモード', 'Pキーで自由飛行カメラ。'],
unlocks: ['Hidden unlocks', 'Locked builds are hidden and pop up an explanation when their condition is met. Off = everything unlocks by depth.', '隠し解放', '未解放の建築は表示されず、条件達成時にポップアップで説明。オフで全て階層に応じて解放。'],
};
